          Under supercritical extraction conditions (P &gt; 73.8 bar, T &gt; 31.1°C), the liquid-vapor meniscus ceases to exist (γ = 0), completely eliminating the destructive Laplace pressure (P_cap = 2γ cosθ / r_pore &gt; 15 MPa in subcritical drying).
        </div>
