        <span class="font-bold text-ink block mb-1">3-A Sanitary Standards 63-04 & 08-17:</span>
        Electro-polished sanitary surface finish (Ra &lt; 0.4 µm) with automated Clean-in-Place (CIP) spray ball integration capable of 2.0% caustic washes at 80°C and sterile gas purges.
      </div>
      <div class="bg-surface p-4 rounded-xl border border-hairline">
        <span class="font-bold text-ink block mb-1">ASME Section VIII Div 1 & ASME B31.3:</span>
        Certified high-pressure process vessel and high-frequency transducer acoustical porting tested for continuous operation up to 250 bar with rupture disk overpressure relief.
